  "description": "Loop with simple loop variable increment: Assume you have a list of 1,000 people in alphabetical order and you are assigned to collect from the first person on the list $1, from the second person $2, and so on from the 1,000th person you collect $1,000. ",
  "code": "class WhileLoopsEx1 {\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\n\n    int sum = 0, i = 1;\n\n    while (i <= 1000) {\n      sum += i;\n      i++;\n    }\n\n    System.out.println(\"Sum = \" + sum);\n  }\n}",
